{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261021/photo/bkn-20261021124712300-1021_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261021155131\"/><p>和樂邨居安樓有人上吊亡。</p><p>觀塘有人上吊亡。今午(21日)12時15分，一名姓梁(62歲)男子在和樂邨居安樓的家中露台以一條領呔上吊，妻子發現後立即將他解下，並且報案求助。救護車接報到場，將陷入昏迷的事主送院搶救，惜他最終證實不治。警員於現場檢獲遺書，事主的死因有待驗屍確定。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-21T07:59:51.887575+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":145,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-21T04:47:12+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-21T07:57:56.576252+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-21T07:57:56.576252+00:00","content_hash":"1b8768f7e0c2fd056dcf035939f7edc3230077bf8e0b53c7133eac8e955738b5","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}